msgid ""
"Phonon selfenergy due to isotope scatterings calculated by Tamura's formula."
" Created when ``MODE = kappa`` and ``ISOTOPE = 2``."
msgstr ""
"Tamura の公式で計算された、同位体散乱 (isotope scatterings) によるフォノン自己エネルギー "
"(selfenergy)。``MODE = kappa`` かつ ``ISOTOPE = 2`` のときに作成されます。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/outputanphon.rst:187
msgid "``PREFIX``.scph.h5 (``PREFIX``.qha.h5 for ``MODE = QHA``)"
msgstr "``PREFIX``.scph.h5 (``MODE = QHA`` では ``PREFIX``.qha.h5)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/tadano/src/alamode/docs/source/anphondir/outputanphon.rst:189
msgid ""
"Unified state file of an SCPH/QHA run (schema ``alamode:scph_state``), "
"written atomically at the end of the run with the default ``FILE_FORMAT = "
"h5``. It bundles everything the legacy ``PREFIX``.scph_dymat / "
"``PREFIX``.renorm_harm_dymat / ``PREFIX``.V0 trio stored (and is the "
"preferred restart source), plus per-temperature convergence flags of the "
"SCPH iteration and the structural optimization (``/convergence/scph``, "
"``/convergence/structure``; unconverged temperatures are refused by later "
"calculations unless :ref:`ALLOW_UNCONVERGED <anphon_allow_unconverged>` is "
"set), and the temperature-dependent effective harmonic force constants in "
"the standard ``/ForceConstants/Order2`` layout: a later anphon run can "
"consume them directly via ``FCSFILE = PREFIX.scph.h5`` together with the "
":ref:`FC2_TEMPERATURE <anphon_fc2_temperature>` tag, replacing the "
"``dfc2.py`` workflow. Readable with h5py."
msgstr ""
"SCPH/QHA 計算の統合状態ファイル (スキーマ ``alamode:scph_state``)。既定の ``FILE_FORMAT = h5`` "
"では計算終了時にアトミックに書き出されます。従来の ``PREFIX``.scph_dymat / "
"``PREFIX``.renorm_harm_dymat / ``PREFIX``.V0 の 3 ファイルが保存していた内容をすべて含み "
"(リスタートの推奨ソースです)、さらに SCPH 反復と構造最適化の温度ごとの収束フラグ "
"(``/convergence/scph``、``/convergence/structure``。収束していない温度は、:ref:`ALLOW_UNCONVERGED"
" <anphon_allow_unconverged>` を設定しない限り後続の計算で拒否されます)、および標準の "
"``/ForceConstants/Order2`` レイアウトによる温度依存の有効調和力定数を含みます。後続の anphon 計算は "
"``FCSFILE = PREFIX.scph.h5`` と :ref:`FC2_TEMPERATURE "
"<anphon_fc2_temperature>` タグによってこれらを直接利用でき、``dfc2.py`` ワークフローを置き換えます。h5py "
"で読むことができます。"

